# Optional, nonsensitive, comment-only template. No variables or copy required.
# Health and the test-only simulated LLM require no key or account.
# Local D1 uses the reviewed DB binding in wrangler.jsonc, not runtime variables.
# Do not add real credentials here or expose server configuration via VITE_*.
# Startup/build/D1 commands explicitly use empty env-file input (/dev/null).
# No hosted database or real model provider is configured.
# Creation limits use nonsensitive Wrangler vars, not a root IP-hashing secret:
# CREATION_ADDRESS_MODE=local-fixed and CONVERSATION_CREATION_LIMIT=10.
# The daily random key is shared in D1 and erased after UTC expiry by scheduling.
# cloudflare-direct is NOT enabled; verify documented ingress topology first.
